# Files the Catalyst packer must never upload.
#
# deploy/features/appsail/pack.js excludes only .DS_Store, .vscode, its own
# log/config/rc/app-config files and this file. It does NOT read .gitignore.
# So without this list, backend/.env — which is gitignored precisely so it is
# never distributed — was being packaged and deployed. Verified 2026-09-01 by
# rebuilding the artifact the packer produces.
#
# Two separate problems that caused:
#   1. SESSION_SECRET, a real secret, was uploaded with the build.
#   2. server.js calls dotenv.config() at startup. dotenv does not override an
#      already-set variable, so injected Catalyst values still win — but any
#      variable Catalyst does NOT inject falls through to the .env value. With
#      the file present the artifact binds PORT=5000 from .env (confirmed by
#      running the packaged tree), and picks up NODE_ENV and a localhost
#      CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS meant only for development.
.env
.env.*
